    {
      "_id": "henrylawson00007",
      "name": "Overload (NPC)",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/magic/lightning/bolt-strike-blue.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-tech-overload",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You fire a concentrated electromagnetic pulse that shreds kinetic shields and fries synthetic circuitry.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>30 feet</strong>. The target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-tech-overload] save against the creature's power DC. Electricity damage dealt to kinetic shields is doubled by the shield system.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d8[electricity]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(2*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d8[electricity]] damage. Synthetic or mech creatures take an additional @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d8[electricity]] damage.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @Damage[(4*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d8[electricity]] damage (plus the synthetic bonus). The target is also <strong>Stunned 1</strong>.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
